  abstract={How to meet the age of intelligence and train the innovative talents needed by the age of intelligence has become a research topic of the education circle. The characteristics of space fusion, man-machine fusion, knowledge explosion and focusing human nature in the age of intelligence put forward new requirements for innovative talents. Creative personality, critical thinking ability, digital learning ability, computational thinking, design thinking, and man-machine collaboration are essential components of creativity in the age of intelligence.},
